# Force LF everywhere regardless of the checking-out machine's core.autocrlf
# setting. This repo is sourced by zsh/bash on Linux/macOS/WSL2 -- a CRLF
# line ending breaks `source`/`[[ -r ]]` paths and can corrupt quoted strings
# (see the ~/.zshrc.local breakage this was written to prevent).
* text=auto eol=lf
